    "summary": "Spend 1 CP right after an enemy unit picks its targets in the opposing player's Shooting phase or in the Fight phase. Pick 1 **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** **Attached unit** of yours that is the target of at least one of the enemy unit's attacks.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, whenever a **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** attack is allocated to one of that unit's **CHARACTER** models while the unit has at least one Bodyguard model, roll a D6. On a 2+, the attack goes to a Bodyguard model you choose in that unit instead.",
